DTSTAMP:20260510T084150Z
UID:019c7342-69a3-534f-21ed-faf3305454b8@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Conversations
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 16\, 2026 at 2 pm\n\nLocation: Level 4\n\nCost:
  Free with general admission\n\nType: Conversations\n\nCostume designer an
 d Academy member Tracy Tynan gives a 30-minute tour unveiling the art of c
 ostume design in films and the process of creating a character’s identit
 y. The tour showcases the way the three leading men in Jaws (1975) highlig
 hted their personas through their distinct costumes.\n\nStay for a brief Q
 &A with Tynan after the tour.
LOCATION:Level 4
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/programs/detail/inside-jaws-costuming
 -characters-019c7342-69a3-534f-21ed-faf3305454b8
