 | English | Rated R | 35mm\nDIRECTED BY: Joel Coen  \nWRITTEN BY: Joel Co
 en\, Ethan Coen  \nWITH: John Turturro\, John Goodman\, Judy Davis\, Mich
 ael Lerner  \nPrint courtesy of the Ed and Maya Herrera collection at the
