 d out by people with seemingly no motive. While struggling to cope with hi
 s wife’s schizophrenia\, Takabe find his investigation leading him to th
 e enigmatic Mamiya (Masato Hagiwara)\, a former psychology student dealing
  with amnesia. Kurosawa uses thriller and horror elements to create an exp
 loration of the existential that is fraught with tension.
